GamePlay => Gameplay / 游玩设置

downScroll => Notes go Down instead of Up, simple enough / 箭头改为从上往下滚动
middleScroll => Put your lane in the center or on the right / 将箭头居中放置
flipChart => Flip chart for playing / 铺面箭头翻转 ，左右键交换，上下键交换
ghostTapping => Toggle counting pressing a directional input when no arrow is there as a miss / 当没有箭头时按下不会判定为Miss
guitarHeroSustains => Hold Notes can't be pressed if you miss / 如果长箭断了，则无法再次触发
noReset => When on, pressing the Reset key (R by default) no longer kills you instantly / 开启后按下 Reset 键（默认 R）不会立刻死亡
showKeybinds => Displays each note lane's assigned key above the receptors when a song starts / 游戏开始时会在箭头上方显示各个箭头的键位


Opponent => Opponent / 对手设置

playOpponent => Playing as opponent / 游玩对手的铺面，相当于你现在是对手
opponentCodeFix => GoodNoteHit and opponentNoteHit function exchange effort / 把GoodNoteHit和opponentNoteHit函数触发进行交换
botOpponentFix => Script will thought you open the bot / 脚本会认为您打开了机器人
healthDrainOPPO => Health Drain on opponent mode / 对手也可以通过击中箭头推条
healthDrainOPPOMult => Health drain multiplier on opponent mode / 对手的推条系数


judgement => Judgement / 箭头判定设置

safeFrames => Changes how many frames you have for hitting a note earlier or late / 修改整体判定大小系数
marvelousWindow => How many milliseconds are in the MARVELOUS judge / 更改Marvelous评分判定的最大区间
sickWindow => How many milliseconds are in the SICK judge / 更改Sick评分判定的最大区间
goodWindow => How many milliseconds are in the GOOD judge / 更改Good评分判定的最大区间
badWindow => How many milliseconds are in the BAD judge / 更改Bad评分判定的最大区间
marvelousRating => Extend marvelous judge for playing / 增加Marvelous判定
marvelousSprite => Marvelous judge will be using new judge sprite / Marvelous评分使用新的贴图
ratingOffset => Changes rate offset / 更改整体判定的偏移
NoteOffsetState => Changes music offset and judgement position / 更改音乐偏移和UI贴图的位置


Gameplaybackend => Gameplay Backend / 游戏后端设置

gameplayGC => Let GameplayGC manage memory collection during songs to reduce GC pauses. This may increase memory usage. / 允许 GameplayGC 在歌曲进行中接管内存回收，以减少 GC 停顿；可能会增加内存占用。
fixLNL => Reduce Long Note length / 减少长键长度
saveScoreBase => playback record storage basis, Score: the highest score, Accuracy: with the highest accuracy, Misses: with the least number of misses, highestCombo: combo most / 回放记录保存基础，Score：分数最高，Accuracy：准确率最高，Misses：错过数最少，highestCombo：连击最多
showReplayWatermark => Shows the replay watermark in the bottom-right corner during playback / 回放时在右下角显示回放水印
gameOverVibration => Device will vibrate at game over / 设备会在你死亡时振动（如果设备支持）
